&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Access Essentials Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Access Essentials team at Okta owns the core control plane backend services, cloud configuration APIs, security and access frameworks, and unified administrative web applications. Our services power core authentication, telemetry pipelines, feature flagging, telephony, certificate management, and admin UI console experiences across Okta&#39;s enterprise footprint. We build scalable, highly available backend microservices and web interfaces that serve millions of users and administrators globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior SET on the Access Essentials team, you will take end-to-end ownership of the test strategy, test automation, and quality engineering for our backend services, cloud APIs, and web frontend applications. You will work closely with local engineering teams, architects, product managers, and cross-functional US partners to design, build, and optimize scalable, automated test solutions that keep release cadences reliable and low-risk for mission-critical cloud infrastructure and admin portal experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a deep understanding of backend microservices architecture, REST/gRPC APIs, web automation frameworks, distributed cloud systems (AWS), continuous integration/continuous deployment (CI/CD) pipelines, and enterprise security standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Automation Framework Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and expand highly reusable test automation frameworks and performance test suites specifically tailored for backend microservices, REST/gRPC APIs, and modern web applications (Admin UI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations &amp;amp; End-to-End Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop automated functional, integration, and E2E regression tests covering complex backend security workflows, cloud-config APIs, authentication protocols, and web UI console journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flaky Test &amp;amp; CI/CD Stability:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead guild initiatives to systematically triage and eliminate flaky UI and API tests, driving deterministic quality gates in build and deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering &amp;amp; Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Transparency &amp;amp; Shift-Left:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed early into product ideation, technical architecture, and PRFAQ/spec reviews with Software Development Engineers (SDEs), Product Managers, and Architects to define quality criteria and perform technical risk analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive comprehensive test strategy, test case creation, execution, and effort estimations for backend services and web applications across the Access Essentials pillar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Debt Reduction:&lt;/strong&gt; Build automated infrastructure to facilitate service refactoring, API version migrations, and seamless database/service optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; DevOps Synergy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and optimize local CI/CD pipelines (leveraging tools like CircleCI, Spinnaker, or GitHub Actions) to enforce rapid, reliable release gates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Infrastructure and Site Reliability Engineering (SRE) teams to optimize mock service environments, manage test data, and maintain robust alert mechanisms for regression detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Technical Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in Software Engineering in Test (SET / SDET) roles, with strong focus on backend microservices, REST APIs, and Web UI application validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong coding skills in &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript/TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; with a proven ability to write clean, scalable, and maintainable automation code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web &amp;amp; API Testing Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on expertise with web UI automation frameworks (Selenium, Cypress, Playwright) and API testing frameworks (Rest Assured, Karate, Postman, or gRPC tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend &amp;amp; Cloud Systems Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of distributed systems architecture, cloud infrastructure (AWS), relational/NoSQL databases, and security protocols (OAuth, OIDC, SAML).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; DevOps Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience working with CI/CD systems (CircleCI, Jenkins, Spinnaker), containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), and logging/observability platforms (Splunk, Datadog, Sentry).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a closely related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with using AI/LLM tools to accelerate test case generation, automation authoring, or defect triage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience testing security software, enterprise Identity and Access Management (IAM) systems, MDMs or multi-tenant SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Front End Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern frontend JavaScript frameworks (React) and enterprise Admin Console UX patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Security Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with performance and load testing frameworks (JMeter, Locust) and security/vulnerability testing practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#P25942&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
